  "goodToKnow": "Die Aufhebung is the lifting, abolition or cancellation of something: die Aufhebung eines Gesetzes, die Aufhebung der Sanktionen. It comes from aufheben, which has three meanings: to pick up, to keep (Heb das auf!) and to abolish. Hegel famously used Aufhebung for all three at once: cancelling, preserving and raising to a higher level. Der Aufhebungsvertrag is a termination agreement at work."
